{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/444_small.png?t=1753387906\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's all about the money, you fool! Build a city, invite adventurers and give them quests, until they solve your problems... of not having enough gold! Do you know how much pet-god food costs these days? Not to mention building a city in a land besieged by monsters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For connoisseurs of unique colony-builders, Gold Gold Adventure Gold is a mix of Cult-of-the-Lamb, Rimworld and Majesty, mixed with Black &amp; White and a pinch of Against the Storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/444_small.png?t=1753387906\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-give-quests.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone knows that adventurers do not work for free.  Their loyalty lies with GOLD! <br>You'll have to recruit them with promises of gold or glory, and give them quests! Kill, defend, explore, and more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/recruit-adventurers.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gold-thirsty adventurers will come from all corners of the world. Humans, beastmen, mothmen, undead and more may join your cause. Pick them all, or only your favorites! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-build-a-city.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div>Build a thriving city around a monster-filled dungeon. Create an economy based on either farming or monster-slaying, and watch as it evolves based on your actions. Whatever you choose, remember to collect your share of the taxes! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-raise-god-beast.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div>The pet you found snacking on your supplies seems to be growing more than expected. Far more. It might be wise to teach it what is right and wrong, before it grows too big to care about your opinions. Raise it, teach it spells or tricks, pet it, brush it, and if necessary discipline it. You might find that it becomes a trusted companion upon your journey! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-watch-citizens.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div>Your units have a life of their own- they might form parties, fund their own buildings, or give each other quests.  Watch your dark alleys closely! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-fight-monsters.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div>As your adventurers clear the world of monsters, you can watch their pathetic struggle against the world. Be merciful and help them survive, get better items, and learn new skills... or feed them to your god-beast. Each level brings them one step closer towards a forbidden evolution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-gobo-jump.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3133650?t=1753387906","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753387906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/9bbe6e54946397e8d2471e39798c3a66f67834f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753387906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/9bbe6e54946397e8d2471e39798c3a66f67834f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753387906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/444_small.png?t=1753387906\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's all about the money, you fool! Build a city, invite adventurers and give them quests, until they solve your problems... of not having enough gold! Do you know how much pet-god food costs these days? Not to mention building a city in a land besieged by monsters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For connoisseurs of unique colony-builders, Gold Gold Adventure Gold is a mix of Cult-of-the-Lamb, Rimworld and Majesty, mixed with Black &amp; White and a pinch of Against the Storm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/444_small.png?t=1753387906\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_