b_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-watch-citizens.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div>Your units have a life of their own- they might form parties, fund their own buildings, or give each other quests.  Watch your dark alleys closely! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-fight-monsters.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div>As your adventurers clear the world of monsters, you can watch their pathetic struggle against the world. Be merciful and help them survive, get better items, and learn new skills... or feed them to your god-beast. Each level brings them one step closer towards a forbidden evolution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/extras/1-gobo-jump.gif?t=1753387906\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></h2>","developers":["Can Can Can a Man"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3133650/12b0a444d4d3f385c72a8ef0085270b28533aba7/header.jpg?t=1753387906","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257079406,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257079406/movie480.mp4?t=1752583737","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257079406/movie_max.mp4?t=1752583737"},"name":"Gold Gold Adventure Gold - Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2